[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15660.389, "timestamp": "04:21:00", "text": "我的天哪。这是卖面包的人送的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15663.59, "timestamp": "04:21:03", "text": "面包师。是的，是用面包做的。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15665.83, "timestamp": "04:21:05", "text": "太可爱了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15669.349, "timestamp": "04:21:09", "text": "真是太有才了。是的。太棒了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15673.269, "timestamp": "04:21:13", "text": "太棒了，兄弟。鸟人。你好。如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15675.83, "timestamp": "04:21:15", "text": "你现在在 Jacqu 的聊天室里，我们来聊聊……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15678.03, "timestamp": "04:21:18", "text": "聊天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15681.189, "timestamp": "04:21:21", "text": "你好。是的。你好。开始游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15683.99, "timestamp": "04:21:23", "text": "好的。是的。有趣的是，我尝试过这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15687.429, "timestamp": "04:21:27", "text": "像我做的那样，做一些很酷的事情"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15689.59, "timestamp": "04:21:29", "text": "唯一一件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15691.67, "timestamp": "04:21:31", "text": "既然你们有二维模型，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15693.429, "timestamp": "04:21:33", "text": "你不必这样做。但我只有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15697.03, "timestamp": "04:21:37", "text": "例如这个PNG模型。所以我想，我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15699.75, "timestamp": "04:21:39", "text": "做些花哨的事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15703.67, "timestamp": "04:21:43", "text": "呃，在你们谈话之后。我就是喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15705.83, "timestamp": "04:21:45", "text": "你们三个都加装了插件，但是呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15707.59, "timestamp": "04:21:47", "text": "不幸的是，一切都崩溃了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15710.07, "timestamp": "04:21:50", "text": "结果烧毁了，里面什么都没装。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15712.55, "timestamp": "04:21:52", "text": "所以，我真的必须默认并这样做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15717.189, "timestamp": "04:21:57", "text": "一切又重新开始了。就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15719.75, "timestamp": "04:21:59", "text": "我在前十分钟就表现不佳"}]